        <button class="settings-tab" data-tab="airport-info">机场信息</button>
        <button class="settings-tab" data-tab="prefix-area">机场区域</button>
        <button class="settings-tab" data-tab="taf-import">预报入库告警</button>
        <button class="settings-tab" data-tab="weather-type">天气类型</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="settings-default-banner" class="settings-default-banner" hidden>正在编辑默认模板。这里保存的内容，会作为其他账号还没有单独设置时使用的默认值。</div>
    <div class="settings-tab-body">

      <!-- Tab1: 机场信息（按四字代码查询） -->
      <div class="settings-tab-pane" id="settings-pane-airport-info">
        <div class="loc-search-wrap airport-info-search">
          <div class="loc-search-bar">
            <input type="text" id="airport-search-input" maxlength="4" class="settings-input loc-search-input"
              placeholder="机场较多，请输入四字代码查询" style="text-transform:uppercase;">
            <button class="settings-btn-save loc-search-btn" id="airport-search-btn">查询</button>
            <button class="settings-add-btn loc-search-btn" id="airport-add-btn" type="button">+ 新增机场</button>
